The annotations and result records in this directory (systems/, results/,
benchmarks.json, extra_systems.json) are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Scores and paper metadata are facts reported by the cited papers; each result
row names its source table. papers.json is generated from the community lists
named in scripts/import_lists.py, which remain under their own licenses.
